{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "6f3d4e2a-9c1b-4d5e-8a7f-lottery-system-0001",
    "name": "抽奖系统 lottery_system 接口测试",
    "description": "抽奖系统全接口测试集合\n\n使用说明：\n1. 导入本 Collection 到 Postman\n2. 在环境变量中配置 baseUrl=http://localhost:8080\n3. 先执行 01_用户模块 → 注册/登录 获取 token（脚本自动写入集合变量 userToken/adminToken）\n4. 依次执行各模块请求\n5. 管理员注册口令：填集合变量 adminSecret（真值见本机 application-local.properties，不入库）\n\n权限说明：\n- /api/faq/*、/api/handover/list、/api/handover/process、/activity/create、/prize/*、/user/base-user/find-list 需 ADMIN token\n- /api/handover/create 需登录 token（普通用户即可）\n- /api/ai/chat/**、/api/chat/** 游客可用\n- 未登录返回 401，普通用户访问管理接口返回 403",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080"
    },
    {
      "key": "adminSecret",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{adminToken}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "01_用户模块",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1.1 注册普通用户",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"name\": \"Postman测试用户\",\n    \"mail\": \"pm_user_001@test.com\",\n    \"phoneNumber\": \"13712340001\",\n    \"password\": \"123456\",\n    \"identity\": \"NORMAL\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/user/register",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["user", "register"]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('注册成功', function() {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(body.code).to.eql(200);",
                  "    pm.expect(body.data.userId).to.be.a('number');",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
